{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/wish.png?t=1746579726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the High Priestess MARY, whose mission is to defend the statue of the Mother Goddess ALEA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the statue is destroyed by the elves, the kingdom of Saint Aquinas will fall before the cursed army of the great sorceress HERA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/Running.gif?t=1746579726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DIVINE POWER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can request the support of the goddess Alea with the Prayer skill to accumulate divine power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This divine power will allow you to perform miracles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can summon divine soldiers from the blessed army; among them are divine knights and nuns of blessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can heal all the soldiers of your sacred guard individually or in groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create a divine image of yourself to block the attackers' movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can communicate with all your soldiers at the same time to summon them to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/GifCombat.gif?t=1746579726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GAMEPLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a while, a group of enemies will appear and rush towards the statue to destroy it. You can't attack enemies yourself; for that, you need the Holy Soldiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, you'll gain experience and increase your power level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will help you improve your skills and those of your Blessed Guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BONUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will include a roguelike/STORE system allowing you to unlock new units to fight more effectively thanks to the divine rewards you collect in battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677580?t=1746579726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/433487d2b63cf89c306ee3593c7cc939c275e353/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746579726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/e8c3c375396d376f65f4118dfa167f49df30b32c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746579726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/e8c3c375396d376f65f4118dfa167f49df30b32c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746579726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/wish.png?t=1746579726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the High Priestess MARY, whose mission is to defend the statue of the Mother Goddess ALEA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the statue is destroyed by the elves, the kingdom of Saint Aquinas will fall before the cursed army of the great sorceress HERA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/Running.gif?t=1746579726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DIVINE POWER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can request the support of the goddess Alea with the Prayer skill to accumulate divine power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This divine power will allow you to perform miracles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can summon divine soldiers from the blessed army; among them are divine knights and nuns of blessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can heal all the soldiers of your sacred guard individually or in groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create a divine image of yourself to block the attackers' movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can communicate with all your soldiers at the same time to summon them to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/GifCombat.gif?t=1746579726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GAMEPLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a while, a group of enemies will appear and rush towards the statue to destroy it. You can't attack enemies yourself; for that, you need the Holy Soldiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, you'll gain experience and increase your power level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will help you improve your skills and those of your Blessed Guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BONUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will include a roguelike/STORE system allowing you to unlock new units to fight more effectively thanks to the divine rewards you collect in battle.</p>","developers":["Oedipe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/afe9dc9a3707e3b82acf707fdd171fa454ae9f97/header.jpg?t=1746579726","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Game has been made by Eddy CHARLES from Oedipe Games","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135008,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135008/movie480.mp4?t=1746402490","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135008/movie_max.mp4?t=1746402490"},"name":"GameplayV3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135008/6f13a2